# Internal research corpus and delivery working papers.
#
# NOT part of the published documentation. These files hold the verified research
# corpus, the gate reports, and the delivery's problem-solving traces. They are
# kept locally because they record internal process (subagent task IDs, local
# absolute paths, a third-party username quoted from an upstream doc example).
#
# `PLAN.md` refers to `.research/` as a provenance path; those references are
# code-span mentions, not hyperlinks, so excluding this directory creates no
# broken links on GitHub.
.research/

# Local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Nothing generated needs committing: the site builds with no toolchain.
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
